Description: Buggy Metaballs, 4k intro by lordcow (2004)
 Buggy Metaballs is a 4k intro written by lordcow for the 2004 4k source
 compo. It renders a real metaball surface (the iso-surface of the sum of
 1/distance fields of points moving around the scene), with a scroll text
 mapped on it and a tiny one-track music engine.
 .
 Part of the data (metaball tables, scroll text and music) is encoded
 into the whitespace of the source code.
